Meta.documentation:Number.max
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Picks the largest Number in the flow.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Emits the largest of all incoming Numbers when the input ends. Emits
Meta.documentation:nothing if there is no input.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_default_$all — each Number to consider
Meta.documentation:@port out_Number_default — the largest of them, emitted at end of input
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:[Number:3 Number:1 Number:2]>>Number.max:>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:3
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see Number.min
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status stable
Meta.documentation:

[Native.Javascript:const%20Resource%20%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FResource%22)%3B%0Aconst%20Number%20%20%20%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FNumber%22)%3B%0A%0Afunction%20max()%0A%7B%0A%20%20this.Number%20%3D%20new%20Number()%3B%0A%09Resource.call(this%2C%22max%22)%3B%0A%09this.Processor%3DmaxProcessor%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20maxProcessor(resource)%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.Processor.call(this%2Cresource)%3B%20%0A%09this.resource%20%3D%20resource%3B%0A%09this.out_Number_default%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09this.in_begin%20%3D%20function()%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09this.tempNumber%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%09this.in_Number_default_%24all%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09if%20(this.tempNumber%20%3D%3D%20null%20%7C%7C%20input.value.compare(this.tempNumber)%20%3E%200)%0A%09%09%09this.tempNumber%20%3D%20input.value%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%09this.in_end%20%3D%20function()%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09if%20(this.tempNumber%20!%3D%20null)%0A%09%09%09return%20this%3F.out_Number_default%3F.(%7Bvalue%3Athis.tempNumber%7D)%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%7D%0Amax.Processor%3DmaxProcessor%3B%0Amodule.exports%3Dmax%3B]>>NewResource:Number.max
